{"id":"alchemy-pot","name":{"en":"Alchemy Pot","ja":"アルケミポット","tc":"鍊金壺","sc":"炼金壶"},"desc1":{"en":"This monster mimics a cauldron used for alchemy.","ja":"「錬金術で使う釜に擬態してる魔物ね」","tc":"「這是擬態成鍊金術用的釜的魔物呢。」","sc":"“这是拟态成炼金术用的釜的魔物呢。”"},"desc2":{"en":"You could use this monster's cauldron for synthesis.Maybe you can get a different effect!I'm going to try it sometime!","ja":"「…なら、この子の釜で調合できたりするかも。　普段の釜とは違う効果があったりして…！　　よし、今度試してみよう！」","tc":"「……既然如此，或許可以用這個釜調合，　說不定會有和一般釜不一樣的效果……！　好，下次試試看吧！」","sc":"“……既然如此，或许可以用这个釜调合，　说不定会有和一般釜不一样的效果……！　好，下次试试看吧！”"},"char1":"liane","char2":"firis","kind":"magical","hp":172,"atk":46,"defen":101,"spd":30,"level":40,"exp":72,"cole":110,"slash":4,"impact":4,"pierce":4,"magic":5,"fire":2,"ice":2,"light":2,"ail":2,"item_set":[{"id":"crackling-water","name":{"en":"Crackling Water","ja":"パチパチ水","tc":"啪汽啪汽水","sc":"啪汽啪汽水"}},{"id":"suspicious-liquid","name":{"en":"Suspicious Liquid","ja":"怪しい液体","tc":"可疑液體","sc":"可疑液体"}},{"id":"neutralizer-r","name":{"en":"Neutralizer R","ja":"中和剤・赤","tc":"中和劑‧紅","sc":"中和剂‧红"}},{"id":"neutralizer-b","name":{"en":"Neutralizer B","ja":"中和剤・青","tc":"中和劑‧藍","sc":"中和剂‧蓝"}},{"id":"neutralizer-y","name":{"en":"Neutralizer Y","ja":"中和剤・黄","tc":"中和劑‧黃","sc":"中和剂‧黄"}},{"id":"neutralizer-g","name":{"en":"Neutralizer G","ja":"中和剤・緑","tc":"中和劑‧綠","sc":"中和剂‧绿"}},{"id":"neutralizer-w","name":{"en":"Neutralizer W","ja":"中和剤・白","tc":"中和劑‧白","sc":"中和剂‧白"}},{"id":"neutralizer-p","name":{"en":"Neutralizer P","ja":"中和剤・紫","tc":"中和劑‧紫","sc":"中和剂‧紫"}},{"id":"rainbow-neutralizer","name":{"en":"Rainbow Neutralizer","ja":"万能中和剤・虹","tc":"萬能中和劑‧虹","sc":"万能中和剂‧虹"}},{"id":"general-catalyst","name":{"en":"General Catalyst","ja":"汎用触媒","tc":"泛用觸媒","sc":"泛用触媒"}},{"id":"distilled-water","name":{"en":"Distilled Water","ja":"蒸留水","tc":"蒸餾水","sc":"蒸馏水"}},{"id":"wheat-flour","name":{"en":"Wheat Flour","ja":"麦粉","tc":"麥粉","sc":"麦粉"}},{"id":"zettel","name":{"en":"Zettel","ja":"ゼッテル","tc":"查科爾帖紙","sc":"查科尔帖纸"}},{"id":"handwoven-cloth","name":{"en":"Handwoven Clo